    "description": "<h3>CHECK IN AT THE WREN & WOLF COUNTER</h3> <h3>PLEASE NOTE THAT AS WITH ANY CLASSIC FLIGHT, PEANUTS ARE A PART OF YOUR IN-FLIGHT SNACK EXPERIENCE.</h3> <h3>DUE TO THE NATURE OF OUR SERVICE, WE CANNOT GUARANTEE A PEANUT-FREE ENVIRONMENT. </h3> <h3>GUESTS WITH SEVERE PEANUT ALLERGIES ARE ADVISED TO EXERCISE CAUTION.</h3> <hr /> <p>Embark on a 90-minute journey back to the golden age of air travel at Carry On! </p> <p>Step into our meticulously designed 1970s aircraft cabin and indulge in vintage-inspired cocktails, each flight transporting you to iconic destinations, with menus that change annually to reflect the flavors and spirits of our departure and arrival points. </p> <p>Your journey begins with a welcome cocktail, accompanied by a serving of our signature in-flight snacks: peanuts and shortbread cookies, all included with your ticket. </p> <p>Additional beverages can be purchased throughout your adventure, but please note, there is no food service beyond the complimentary snack\u2026\n\nUpdated by TASK-3029: city/state components parsed from Google Places-backed address",
